        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Florey, R. G. Springsteen, Charles Irwin, Robert Creighton Williams\n- Films: Dangerous to Know, He Rides Tall\n- Roles: director, screenwriter, film journalist, actor, writer\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Florey was born on 14 September 1900 and died on 16 May 1979.\n- Robert G. Springsteen was born on September 8, 1904 and died on December 9, 1989.\n- Robert Florey was a French-American director, screenwriter, film journalist, and occasional actor.\n- Robert G. Springsteen was an American director of Hollywood B movies and television shows.\n- Dangerous to Know was directed by Robert Florey.\n- He Rides Tall is a 1964 American Western film directed by R. G. Springsteen.\n- He Rides Tall was written by Charles Irwin and Robert Creighton Williams.",
